felix-cache/
data/
instances/
*.kar

### Sokybot ###
sokybot-core/sokybot.data
sokybot-core/felix-cache
sokybot-core/sokybot-cache
Sokybot-*/
sokybot-static-resources/felix-cache
sokybot-static-resources/sokybot-osgi-platform
*.pk2
*.data
*.mv
*.trace

